OL,3,GNEWSASerious crash closes M42 near     
OL,4,ABirmingham Airport                     
OL,6,FInvestigation work was expected to take
OL,7,Fseveral hours, National Highways said, 
OL,8,Fafter which recovery of the vehicle and
OL,9,Fclearance of debris would need to be   
OL,10,Fcompleted before the road could reopen.
